WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.296
Watch and read: Ama asks: In a dictionary, the word “garden” means:

00:00:05.117 --> 00:00:09.682
The answer is: land where plants grow. A dictionary gives the meanings of words.

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:15.251
Watch and read: For your prediction practice, read: “Ama found a red ball at the

00:00:15.251 --> 00:00:19.968
playground. Ama gave it back to Kojo. The day ended happily.” Who is the main

00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:20.283
character?

00:00:21.117 --> 00:00:25.234
The answer is: Ama. The character is the person the story is about.
